\n\
I want to get Temple Garden - it gives me both W and G. With Mountain (R) + Temple Garden (G), I can cast Territorial Kavu, and the domain count would be Mountain (Mountain type), Temple Garden (Forest + Plains types) = 3 basic land types, making Kavu a 3/3. That's great!\n\
\n\
Let me also think about Teferi next turn - I'd need U. I have Godless Shrine in hand (W/B), so next turn I could play that and then with another fetch find a blue source.\n\
\n\
Temple Garden is the pick - it maximizes domain AND gives me the green for Kavu.",
