      "reasoning": "The second Kavu trigger also chose the discard mode. I need to discard again. I have Leyline of the Guildpact, Scion of Draco, and Teferi.\n\
\n\
Let me think carefully:\n\
- **Leyline of the Guildpact** costs {G/W}{G/U}{B/G}{R/G} = 4 mana, all hybrid with green. I can pay it with 4 green sources, or a mix. With my current lands (Mountain, Temple Garden, Godless Shrine, Arid Mesa), I could pay GWGW from my lands... actually I don't have enough green right now. Let me check: I need 4 mana, each with a G option. Temple Garden gives G, Arid Mesa can fetch... I'd need to crack the Mesa for a land.\n\
- **Scion of Draco** with Leyline out would cost 12 - 10 (5 types × 2) = 2 mana. That's incredible.\n\
- **Teferi** needs {1}{W}{U} - I need a blue source.\n\
\n\
I should keep Leyline of the Guildpact - it combos perfectly with Scion and makes Kavus 5/5. Teferi needs blue mana I don't have. I'll discard Teferi and draw.\n\
\n\
Actually wait - next turn I could crack Arid Mesa to find an Island or blue source... but Arid Mesa only finds Mountain or Plains. So I can't easily get blue for Teferi anyway. Discard Teferi.",
